{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Chargeable Weight Calculator"},"description":"Calculate air freight chargeable weight \u2014 the greater of actual gross weight and volumetric weight, which is what airlines bill. Volumetric weight (kg) = (L x W x H in cm) / divisor; the IATA-standard divisor is 6,000 (1 CBM = 166.67 kg), while express integrators (DHL, FedEx, UPS) typically use 5,000.\n\nBehavior: deterministic; the dimensions are per piece and gross_weight_kg is the TOTAL for all pieces; totals are computed from unrounded figures and rounded only for display (10,000 pieces of 5 x 5 x 6 cm = 250 kg); basis reports which weight governs (\"volumetric\" = cargo is light for its size, \"actual\" = dense). Air mode only \u2014 sea W/M (1 CBM = 1,000 kg) is covered by consignment_calculator with mode=sea. Missing or non-positive inputs error with the failing parameter named. Rate-limited: a limit error carries reset_at, the UTC time the allowance resets.\n\nReturns: chargeable_weight_kg, basis, volumetric_weight_kg (the total; the hosted endpoint names it volumetricWeightTotalKg) and volumetric_weight_per_piece_kg, gross_weight_kg, cbm, ratio, factor and pieces under result; normalized_input echoes the interpreted inputs (gross_weight_basis, dimensions_basis) and any defaults applied; plus confidence, _source and citation (the FreightUtils v1 response envelope). Field names as this package serves them (snake_case); the hosted /api/mcp endpoint serves the same fields in camelCase (e.g. total_cbm \u2192 totalCbm).\n\nRelated: cbm_calculator (volume only), consignment_calculator (multi-line, all modes), uld_lookup (the equipment the freight flies in).","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"factor":{"description":"Volumetric divisor in cm\u00b3/kg. Default: 6000 (IATA standard); express carriers typically 5000.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"gross_weight_kg":{"description":"Actual gross weight of the WHOLE shipment (all pieces) in kilograms. Example: 500.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"height_cm":{"description":"Height of one piece in centimetres (> 0). Example: 100.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"length_cm":{"description":"Length of one piece in centimetres (> 0). Example: 120.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"pieces":{"description":"Number of identical pieces. Default: 1.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"width_cm":{"description":"Width of one piece in centimetres (> 0). Example: 80.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["length_cm","width_cm","height_cm","gross_weight_kg"],"type":"object"},"name":"chargeable_weight_calculator","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"_meta":{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"check_id":{"type":"string"},"edition_basis":{"type":"string"},"identify":{"type":"string"},"receipt":{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"created_at":{"type":"string"},"dataset_version":{"additionalProperties":{"type":"string"},"propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"engine_version":{"type":"string"},"inputs":{},"reason":{"const":"key_required","type":"string"},"receipt_hash":{"type":"string"},"result":{"additionalProperties":{},"propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"schema_version":{"type":"string"},"stored":{"const":false,"type":"boolean"},"tool":{"type":"string"}},"required":["stored","reason","schema_version","receipt_hash","created_at","tool","inputs","dataset_version","engine_version","result"],"type":"object"},"receipt_url":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"_source":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"authority_current_edition":{"type":"string"},"checked":{"type":"string"},"checked_at":{"type":"string"},"dat